1
00:00:00,125 --> 00:00:02,995
(Leonard:)Penny says they're having fun
working on the prototype.

2
00:00:02,994 --> 00:00:06,664
(Howard:)Remember when her fun was
nightclubs and drinking games?

3
00:00:06,665 --> 00:00:09,295
(Leonard:)I know. I'm lowering
the bar so slowly.

4
00:00:09,301 --> 00:00:12,431
(Leonard:)This time next year
she'll have a coin collection.

5
00:00:12,437 --> 00:00:13,837
(Man:)Excuse me.

6
00:00:13,838 --> 00:00:16,108
(Man:)You guys interested in a free
screening of an upcoming movie?

7
00:00:16,107 --> 00:00:17,007
(Leonard:)Oh. Sorry, we can't.

8
00:00:17,008 --> 00:00:18,978
(Howard:)Well, hang on.
What movie is it?

9
00:00:18,977 --> 00:00:21,777
(Man:)Oh, I can't tell you.
But it does star Will Smith.

10
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:23,650
(Howard:)Wait.

11
00:00:23,648 --> 00:00:25,078
I bet it's Suicide Squad.

12
00:00:25,083 --> 00:00:26,883
(Howard:)Let's check it out.

13
00:00:26,885 --> 00:00:28,085
(Leonard:)What about the girls?

14
00:00:28,086 --> 00:00:29,886
(Howard:)Penny just said
they're having fun.

15
00:00:29,888 --> 00:00:32,418
(Howard:)Honestly, you want to wrap tape
around a bunch of pipe fittings

16
00:00:32,424 --> 00:00:33,894
(Howard:)all afternoon?

17
00:00:34,859 --> 00:00:36,089
(Leonard:)Okay, we'll take 'em.

18
00:00:36,094 --> 00:00:37,924
(Leonard:)Okay.
But, I swear,

19
00:00:37,929 --> 00:00:39,929
(Leonard:)if it's Will Smith
in Shark Tale 2,

20
00:00:39,931 --> 00:00:43,301
(Leonard:)it better be at least as good
as the original.

21
00:00:44,536 --> 00:00:46,206
(Penny:)I mean, it's crazy,
isn't it?

22
00:00:46,204 --> 00:00:48,334
(Penny:)I moved here from Nebraska
to be an actress,

23
00:00:48,340 --> 00:00:51,310
(Penny:)and now I'm sitting
in an engineering lab at Caltech

24
00:00:51,309 --> 00:00:55,509
(Penny:)helping to build a prototype
for a high-tech guidance system.

25
00:00:55,513 --> 00:00:57,513
(Bernadette:)It is crazy. It's also crazy

